<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Welcome to RizzFitt!</h2>
        <div>
            <p style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 16px;">Dear {{name}},</p>

            <p style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; color: #6F7782;">
                You've been invited to join RizzFitt! We're excited to have you on board and can't wait for you to get started.
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: 500; font-size: 16px; color: #6F7782;">
                To complete your registration, please click the button below:
            </p>

            <a href="{{url}}" style="
                background: #F18925;
                border-radius: 3px;
                padding: 8px;
                font-weight: 500;
                font-size: 14px;
                line-height: 21px;
                color: #FFFFFF;
                text-decoration: none !important;
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 16px 0;">
                Complete Registration
            </a>

            <p style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 14px; color: #6F7782; margin-top: 28px;">
                If the button above doesn't work, you can copy and paste the following URL into your browser. This invitation link will expire in 24 hours.
            </p>

            <p>
                {{url}}
            </p>
            <p style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 14px; color: #6F7782; margin-top: 28px;">
                If you have any questions or need assistance during the registration process, our support team is here to help.
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 14px; color: #6F7782; margin-top: 28px;">
                We look forward to having you as part of our community!
            </p>

            <p style="font-weight: normal; font-size: 14px; color: #6F7782; margin-top: 28px;">
                Best Regards,<br>
                <span>RizzFitt Team</span>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>